    question: 'Design the sequencing for a maintenance window that bumps the NVIDIA driver, CUDA toolkit, and Slurm version together, given a compatibility matrix showing all three change and NIC firmware stays unchanged but unvalidated since the last bump.',
    followUp: 'Why does validating driver+CUDA compatibility before touching the orchestrator (Slurm/Kubernetes) version specifically reduce triage time, with a concrete symptom example?',
